<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
    <title>4 צעדים לביטחון עצמי - מדריך פיתוי ממיר</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts: Rubik & Heebo -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Heebo:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Rubik:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,900;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        galaxy: {
                            950: '#04010a',
                            900: '#0a0418',
                            850: '#110729',
                            800: '#1b0d3e',
                            700: '#2d1460',
                            600: '#431d8e',
                            500: '#602eb1'
                        },
                        subtlePurple: {
                            100: '#f3e8ff',
                            200: '#e9d5ff',
                            300: '#d8b4fe',
                            400: '#c084fc',
                            500: '#a855f7',
                            600: '#9333ea'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Heebo', 'sans-serif'],
                        heading: ['Rubik', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        window.handleGateSubmit = function(event) {
            if (event) event.preventDefault();
            
            var nameInput = document.getElementById('leadName');
            var name = nameInput ? nameInput.value.trim() : '';
            
            if (name) {
                var nameDisplay = document.getElementById('userNameDisplay');
                if (nameDisplay) {
                    nameDisplay.textContent = name;
                }
                var welcomeBanner = document.getElementById('personalizedWelcome');
                if (welcomeBanner) {
                    welcomeBanner.classList.remove('hidden');
                }
            }
            
            var modal = document.getElementById('leadModal');
            if (modal) {
                modal.classList.add('hidden');
            }
            
            document.body.classList.remove('modal-active');
            return false;
        };
    </script>
    
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #04010a;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Heebo', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.7;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        .stars-bg {
            background-color: #04010a;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 15px 25px, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(2px 2px at 50px 90px, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.9), rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 110px 40px, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(2px 2px at 170px 140px, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.95), rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 230px 190px, #e9d5ff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(2.5px 2.5px at 300px 70px, rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.85), rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.45), transparent 55%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 40%, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.35), transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 65%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35), transparent 55%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.25), transparent 50%);
            background-repeat: repeat, repeat, repeat, repeat, repeat, repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat;
            background-size: 240px 240px, 320px 320px, 200px 200px, 360px 360px, 280px 280px, 310px 310px, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        .apple-emoji {
            font-family: 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Noto Color Emoji', sans-serif;
        }

        .glow-deep-purple {
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px -8px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35), 0 0 20px -4px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.25);
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(10, 4, 24, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px -10px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35), inset 0 0 30px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.15);
        }

        .glow-text {
            text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 20px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.45);
        }

        .btn-galaxy {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4c1d95 0%, #c026d3 40%, #db2777 75%, #2563eb 100%);
            background-size: 200% 200%;
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(192, 38, 211, 0.45), 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
        }

        .btn-galaxy:hover, .btn-galaxy:focus {
            background-position: right center;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -4px rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.6), 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-galaxy:active {
            transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.99);
        }

        .modal-active {
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        textarea::-webkit-scrollbar, div::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 5px;
        }
        textarea::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb, div::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #7e22ce;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="stars-bg min-h-screen relative antialiased selection:bg-fuchsia-600 selection:text-white modal-active">

    <!-- LEAD CAPTURE MODAL -->
    <div id="leadModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-5 stars-bg bg-galaxy-950/80 backdrop-blur-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        
        <div class="absolute w-80 h-80 sm:w-96 sm:h-96 bg-fuchsia-600/30 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -top-12 -right-12 animate-pulse"></div>
        <div class="absolute w-80 h-80 sm:w-96 sm:h-96 bg-purple-600/30 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -bottom-12 -left-12"></div>

        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg glass-card rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-8 border border-fuchsia-400/50 glow-deep-purple max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto space-y-5 my-auto shadow-2xl shadow-fuchsia-950/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-galaxy-900/90 via-galaxy-950/95 to-galaxy-900/90">
            
            <div class="text-center space-y-3 relative z-10">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 sm:w-13 sm:h-13 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 via-fuchsia-600 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl sm:text-2xl mx-auto shadow-md shadow-fuchsia-600/40 select-none border border-fuchsia-300/40 p-0.5">
                    <span class="apple-emoji leading-none">📝</span>
                </div>

                <h2 class="font-heading text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug px-1 drop-shadow-md">
                    <span class="text-subtlePurple-200 font-black">4 צעדים</span> להתגבר על ביישנות ולבנות <span class="text-fuchsia-300 underline decoration-fuchsia-400/60 underline-offset-4">ביטחון עצמי משוחרר מול אנשים</span>
                </h2>

                <div class="text-slate-100 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2 pt-0.5 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    <p class="text-purple-100 drop-shadow-sm">
                        רגע לפני שהמדריך נפתח עבורך –<br>
                        הוא יעזור לך להבין איך להשתחרר יותר מול אנשים<br>
                        ומה באמת עוצר אותך מלבטא את עצמך כמו שהיית רוצה.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-subtlePurple-200 font-bold text-xs sm:text-base pt-1 drop-shadow-sm">
                        לאן לשלוח את הבונוס הנוסף? 🎁
                    </p>
